        "code": {
          "text": "Acute mechanical left-sided low back pain consistent with acute nociceptive musculoskeletal strain, moderate severity"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Acute left-sided low back pain for approximately 10 days, beginning after lifting heavy stock boxes at work. Initially a sharp twinge, now a constant dull ache rated 4/10 at baseline with intermittent sharper pain rated 7–8/10 on flexion, twisting, or rolling in bed. Localised to the left lumbar region without radiation below the knee. Limits ability to complete full shifts; patient sits more and avoids heavier lifting."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back pain red-flag symptoms and relevant history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies leg weakness, numbness, paraesthesia, saddle anaesthesia, bowel or bladder incontinence, urinary retention, trauma or fall, fever, weight loss, intravenous drug use, and history of malignancy. No significant previous back issues reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back inspection and palpation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No deformity, bruising, or swelling. Localised tenderness to palpation of the left paraspinal muscles approximately L3–L5 with increased tone and spasm. No midline bony tenderness."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Back range of motion"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Flexion and extension mildly reduced due to pain. Left side flexion reproduces pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lower limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Power 5/5 at hips, knees, and ankles bilaterally. Patellar and Achilles reflexes 2+ and symmetrical. Light touch and pin sensation intact L2–S1 bilaterally."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
